{{-- The "how to reach us" phrase used inside a sentence on the legal pages. With PRIVACY_CONTACT_EMAIL set it is a mailto link; without it, it says who to ask instead, so no page ever shows an empty or made up address. This file must NOT end with a newline (it would show as a space before the full stop), and the empty PHP tag before the last directive is there because Blade only sees a directive that does not touch a letter. --}}@php $contact = config('legal.contact_email'); @endphp@if ($contact)<a href="mailto:{{ $contact }}">{{ $contact }}</a>@else the school administrator or the TaraBasa AI team who gave you access<?php ?>@endif